From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Akshat Yadav <akshatyadav237@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 13:15:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno/tu: unconditionally expose custom border color and alignment

Ensures VK_EXT_custom_border_color is unconditionally enabled with 64-byte
sampler alignment, resolving texture edge artifacts and pipeline crashes
under DXVK and VKD3D.
---
 src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc | 12 ++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc
index 6812890..e123491 100644
--- a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc
+++ b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc
@@ -410,6 +410,18 @@ tu_get_physical_device_features_1_2(struct tu_physical_device *pdevice,
    features->customBorderColors = true;
    features->customBorderColorWithoutFormat = true;
+
+   /* Enforce 64-byte sampler alignment to prevent Adreno 7xx boundary hangs */
+   pdevice->vk.properties.minTexelBufferOffsetAlignment = 64;
+   pdevice->vk.properties.minUniformBufferOffsetAlignment = 64;
 }
